"description":"Martva prepares you for Georgia's driving license theory exam, and it trains you the way a good instructor would: it remembers every mistake you make and turns it into your practice plan.\n\nBuilt around your mistakes\n• Every wrong answer is remembered and becomes a one-tap review queue\n• Weak topics surface automatically, so you always know what to study next\n• Bookmark tricky questions and search the entire ticket bank\n• Browse and study by topic, with explanations\n\nReal exam simulation\n• Question count, time limit and allowed mistakes all match your license category, exactly like the official exam\n• Instant results with a full answer review\n\nYour language\n• Questions in Georgian, English, Russian, Turkish, and Azerbaijani\n• App interface in Georgian and English\n\nYour data stays yours\n• Works fully offline, no internet needed at all\n• No account, no registration, no ads\n• Your progress is stored only on your device\n\nWhether you're going for category B, motorcycle, truck, or bus, Martva gives you the same questions, the same rules, and the same time pressure you'll face on exam day.\n\nThis app is an independent study aid and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or authorized by any Georgian government agency.\n\nQuestions or feedback? Reach me at zazagdev@gmail.com", "bundleId":"com.martva.app", "trackCensoredName":"Martva - Driving License", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/ge/app/martva-driving-license/id6795477065?uo=4", "averageUserRating":5, "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "primaryGenreName":"Education", "primaryGenreId":6017, "price":0.00, "minimumOsVersion":"15.1", "userRatingCount":5}]
